{
  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Best Greek Salad Recipe",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Lisa Bryan"
  },
  "description": "This Greek salad is fresh, easy, and made with the best homemade Greek salad dressing! Watch the video below to see how it all comes together.",
  "datePublished": "2023-05-10T08:00:00+00:00",
  "image": [
    "https://i2.wp.com/www.downshiftology.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/Greek-Salad-main.jpg"
  ],
  "video": {
    "name": "EASY GREEK SALAD RECIPE | plus meal prep ideas & tips!",
    "description": "This traditional Greek salad recipe (horiatiki salata) is super easy and healthy. Made from only 6 ingredients, it's one of the best healthy salad recipes!\n\nGreek salad highlights the beauty of the Mediterranean diet, where a few simple, fresh ingredients in their most natural form turn into a dazzling salad. Pair it with my homemade Greek salad dressing and you’re good to go! \n\nWhat I love most about this Greek salad recipe is that it’s veggie-packed and contains no leafy greens. That means all of the ingredients can be prepped ahead of time (as I showed in my summer meal prep), then tossed together when you’re ready to serve. So needless to say, it’s the perfect summer salad recipe that’s always on repeat. Plus, I give a few ideas in the video on how to add protein for a heartier meal!\n\n🖨 Printable Greek Salad Recipe:\n\nSign up for weekly emails (never miss a recipe!):\n\nJoin the private Facebook group of fellow Downshifters around the world:\n\n► ORDER MY COOKBOOK!!!\nGet 100+ make-ahead and quick-assembly recipes in my NEW Healthy Meal Prep cookbook:\n\n► ALWAYS IN MY KITCHEN:\nCounter Stools:\nVitamix Blender:\nSpiralizer:\nTea Kettle:\nUtensil Holder:\nFlour Jars:\nSalt Cellar:\nKnife Set:\nWhite Chef's Knife:\nCutting Board:\nMagnetic Measuring Spoons:\nMagnetic Measuring Cups:\nFood Scraper:\n\nFor everything else I use in my videos, check out the SHOP page on my website:\n\n► TIMESTAMPS:\n00:00 Intro\n00:30 Slice and dice the vegetables\n03:37 Add the feta cheese\n04:04 Make the Greek salad dressing and stir together\n05:25 Cook and meal prep herb baked chicken to add to the salad\n06:59 Add beans for a vegetarian protein option\n07:50 Taste test\n\n► WHAT I'M WEARING\nTop (similar):\nJeans:\nLinen Apron:\n\nThe music I use: - Great music for YouTubers!\n\nDisclaimer: product links may include affiliate links.\n#greeksalad #saladrecipe #mediterranean",
    "uploadDate": "2023-05-10T15:32:01+00:00",
    "duration": "PT8M16S",
    "thumbnailUrl": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dDhOpHcAJGo/hqdefault.jpg",
    "embedUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/dDhOpHcAJGo?feature=oembed",
    "contentUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dDhOpHcAJGo",
    "@type": "VideoObject"
  },
  "recipeYield": [
    "4",
    "4 servings"
  ],
  "prepTime": "PT5M",
  "totalTime": "PT5M",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "1  large cucumber (diced)",
    "1 pint grape tomatoes (halved)",
    "1  green bell pepper (diced)",
    "½  red onion (thinly sliced)",
    "½ cup Kalamata olives (halved)",
    "4 ounces feta cheese (crumbled)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "⅓ cup red wine vinegar",
    "1  lemon (juiced)",
    "1 teaspoon Dijon mustard",
    "2  garlic cloves (minced)",
    "½ teaspoon dried oregano",
    "¼ teaspoon salt",
    "¼ teaspoon black pepper",
    "½ cup olive oil"
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Add the cucumber, tomatoes, bell pepper, onion, olives, and feta cheese to a large mixing bowl.",
      "name": "Add",
      "url": "https://downshiftology.com/recipes/greek-salad/#wprm-recipe-33273-step-0-0",
      "image": "https://downshiftology.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/How-To-Make-Greek-Salad-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "In a separate small mixing bowl, add the vinegar, lemon juice, mustard, garlic, oregano, salt, and pepper. Slowly add the olive oil and whisk vigorously while pouring until the dressing is emulsified.",
      "name": "Whisk dressing",
      "url": "https://downshiftology.com/recipes/greek-salad/#wprm-recipe-33273-step-0-1",
      "image": "https://i2.wp.com/www.downshiftology.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/How-To-Make-Greek-Salad-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Drizzle the dressing on the salad and gently stir to combine. Season with additional salt and pepper, if desired.",
      "name": "Drizzle and toss",
      "url": "https://downshiftology.com/recipes/greek-salad/#wprm-recipe-33273-step-0-2",
      "image": "https://downshiftology.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/How-To-Make-Greek-Salad-2.jpg"
    }
  ],
  "aggregateRating": {
