        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Made this the other night to accompany our lamb loin chops. Both were delicious and will definitely make this again. The dressing is especially yummy.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Nancy"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-10-12"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Yummy salad. I added a can of drained and rinsed garbanzo beans and some fresh dill.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Susan S"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-09-22"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Danielle, I did find Lisa's recipe for this Greek dressing elsewhere on her site.  It is using the same ingredient measurements, but says it serves 8!   So... even though the Greek Salad serves 4, the dressing is enough for double batch.  I'm planning on making a 4x batch of salad to serve 16 tomorrow, but will only double the dressing recipe as shown here. I'm very thankful for your mention, as I don't want an excess of dressing left in the bowl.🙂",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Sandra Smith"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-08-07"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Made this salad for my husband and I and we both loved it!  We had it with the Greek Lemon chicken and it was the perfect complement to the main dish!  The salad was refreshing and perfect for a summer dinner!!",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Sylvia"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-07-19"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "I made this salad exactly from your recipe and it was amazing and my husband also agreed – loved the dressing and I will be making this many times again. It is a great dish to share and I can see it disappearing every time. Keep up the great work.🤗",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "barbara"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-06-22"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Oh god , wonderful flavours ! I loved it! I’ve had some Zaatar and Sumac spices in the sauce.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "PAULINE"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-06-10"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "I made a massive batch of this for a celebration of life and it was a huge hit! Although the recipe (for 3x the batch) made waaaay too much dressing (there was a little pool of dressing in both batches I made and there was about 2-3 cups of dressing leftover; which felt like a bit of a waste of ingredients, considering the cost of groceries these days) If you decide to make 3x the amount, only make 2x the amount of dressing - unless you want leftover dressing for the fridge. \r\n\r\nVery tasty though! Will definitely make again",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Danielle"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-06-07"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Fantastic salad and dressing! We make this all the time now. Thank you!",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Sue"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-06-03"
    }
